#: cbac0fb82146409287ddb6ea224623ee dacfafab144b49b9a0054e5f24c8dab0
msgid "Kebni SensAItion External AHRS"
msgstr "Kebni SensAItion 外部 AHRS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:7
#: 03456c2d802042679a36c4af62880e4f 34fb0cd9c23c4e4fb52dd333aae71e30
#: 4b93ca7909614b5c8c67d476d0d01b76 c61853fb1a59435fb47bd192b4549dd8
msgid "The Kebni SensAItion range includes three sensor models:"
msgstr "Kebni SensAItion 系列包含三种传感器型号："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:9
#: 18ebbe7e40424e4e99c0cba94bc53189 591a093b785242f3ac8a5ae33fde9a79
#: b4df52d109bb4b88b1f14c152184d309 be19e26d9291450ea4c88b1f30ed4982
msgid ""
"**IMU**: Measures acceleration, rotation (gyro rates), magnetic field and "
"air pressure"
msgstr "**IMU**：测量加速度、旋转（陀螺仪速率）、磁场和气压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:10
#: 228a5419fd274331ac233530205b5465 3906344458934480b59eae6a2e85abab
#: c8653d33ad37438eaf23f2cb4dff0ec0 dc617b491389447a849542523b4e0842
msgid ""
"**AHRS**: As above, but also estimates the orientation (roll, pitch and "
"yaw/heading) of the sensor"
msgstr "**AHRS**：同上，但还会估计传感器的姿态（横滚、俯仰和偏航/航向）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:11
#: 223604dc5e4f405fad1c3dc02f83175d 86f664124ea3451e978c01780fda2133
#: 8ff0adc88ec14513946f5d798e9cedd1 e97311a83ad648fc983a5678e9211dd4
msgid ""
"**INS**: As above, but with two built-in satellite navigation receivers to "
"get position (using Fixed Base RTK for higher precision if provided with "
"correction data), UTC time and heading (if using two antennas with a "
"sufficient baseline between them)"
msgstr ""
"**INS**：同上，但内置两个卫星导航接收机，可获取位置（若提供改正数据，可使用固定基准站 RTK 获得更高精度）、UTC "
"时间和航向（需使用两副天线且两者之间基线足够长）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:13
#: 073e496fc8d846db947d4d3a9727eab6 bbc1878a8c674b6fba44b5c51d9aff67
#: e39a42b7dfd34307a6326f78a3bb1db8 e51cf1b6b99645c0908ff4926cabe2e1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The SensAItion range of sensors contain high-performance gyros and "
"accelerometers that are individually calibrated and temperature compensated "
"for the interval -40 to +70 :math:`^\\circ\\text{C}` and thus do not need "
"any warm-up period to provide precise measurements. The built-in sensor "
"fusion engine also uses a barometer and magnetometer to improve the "
"estimation of altitude and heading, respectively. The INS version of the "
"sensor further includes satellite positioning in the sensor fusion, with "
"precise internal synchronization between the satellite position fixes and "
"the IMU measurements to get the best performance."
msgstr ""
"SensAItion 系列传感器内含高性能陀螺仪和加速度计，逐台校准并在 -40 至 +70 :math:`^\\circ\\text{C}` "
"区间内做温度补偿，因此无需任何预热时间即可提供精确测量。内置的传感器融合引擎还分别使用气压计和磁力计来改善高度和航向的估计。INS "
"版本的传感器进一步将卫星定位纳入传感器融合，卫星定位解算与 IMU 测量之间具有精确的内部同步，以获得最佳性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:20
#: 9007d3011eb443d78b7cba8fe3bbdefe b692bd466f95417eb64c45f6cc7b8bdf
#: f122eae8729c46b08ab3a04135b94768 f97dc13a06c841799c07c436c206bcc4
msgid ""
"For easier integration into various customer applications, each model exists"
" in two hardware versions: a rugged version in an IP67 aluminium housing or "
"a low-profile OEM version that can easily be mounted on an application-"
"specific circuit board. Details and specifications for each model can be "
"found on `Kebni's product homepage <https://www.kebni.com/products/inertial-"
"sensing/sensaition-imu-ins/>`__."
msgstr ""
"为便于集成到各种客户应用中，每种型号都有两个硬件版本：装在 IP67 铝制外壳内的加固版，以及可方便地安装到应用专用电路板上的薄型 OEM "
"版。各型号的详细信息和规格参见 `Kebni 产品主页 <https://www.kebni.com/products/inertial-"
"sensing/sensaition-imu-ins/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:25
#: 0e3c5fd8956143e493a1baeb15baabc4 5dabf213f85f49d29d5a34b02bb8c61e
#: 5ffd0ee24b5e49c89c6babbd725409c3 bbd6e95ff8d84b7bb8b918d9b43a9333
msgid "The SensAItion External AHRS driver can work in two modes:"
msgstr "SensAItion 外部 AHRS 驱动可工作在两种模式下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:27
#: 321f05599e3c4372a08c57ca4775b4ef 54cfaf13bd1547deb910719eeae23658
#: 7cb8340d2799482f831e3697894e4d96 f3047c787df3499e828b8c5693b8b63f
msgid ""
"**IMU**: It should be connected to the IMU or AHRS model of SensAItion and "
"will feed raw sensor data to the ArduPilot EKF3 estimator, which will fuse "
"it with GPS positions from another source and compute a navigation solution."
msgstr ""
"**IMU**：应连接 SensAItion 的 IMU 或 AHRS 型号，向 ArduPilot EKF3 估计器提供原始传感器数据，由 EKF3 "
"将其与来自其他来源的 GPS 位置融合并计算导航解。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:28
#: 353463bc01cc47ac8ef121cc929fcff1 46938836c4a9471ba9fe009968bfd9a3
#: 4d5734b985ab4325940252b1951ba59a 6bb1c54628b6418aa582ffde17637ab6
msgid ""
"**Interleaved INS**: It should be connected to the INS model of SensAItion, "
"which will run sensor fusion and provide a full navigation solution, "
"replacing the EKF3 estimator. In order not to overload the serial port, the "
"high-rate IMU messages are interleaved with lower-rate positions and "
"orientations. This interleaving requires the sensor to have firmware version"
" 2.69 or newer."
msgstr ""
"**交错 INS**：应连接 SensAItion 的 INS 型号，由传感器自行运行传感器融合并提供完整导航解，取代 EKF3 "
"估计器。为避免串口过载，高速率的 IMU 消息与较低速率的位置和姿态消息交错发送。此交错功能要求传感器固件版本为 2.69 或更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:31
#: 0bb25a516c514229a6920d9e7d93dd45 1f23542bb18a4d298083384677056728
#: 74fb35ed13784a77bdef0b388aa733c0 8a909e556b434d8e8a8d053804c2647b
msgid "Hardware setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:32
#: 26b45d30a81041b6a5e0082395b2a7e5 6dd5550e9ac14f0187432946902ad579
#: e999fb6dbd9e499ea7b01db1971760b5 fdc44570d78e416c8cb4473e671e0642
msgid ""
"Connect the SensAItion Data UART pins (TX, RX and ground) to an available "
"serial port on the ArduPilot platform, such as GPS or TELEM. Power the "
"sensor as described in the User Manual. Both the rugged and OEM version of "
"the sensor have the required serial port connections available. Please note "
"that the rugged sensor version has output voltage levels +/-5 V, while the "
"OEM sensor version has output voltage levels of 0 and +3.3 V."
msgstr ""
"将 SensAItion 的 Data UART 引脚（TX、RX 和地）连接到 ArduPilot 平台上可用的串口，如 GPS 或 "
"TELEM。按用户手册所述为传感器供电。加固版和 OEM 版传感器都提供所需的串口连接。请注意，加固版传感器的输出电平为 +/-5 V，而 OEM "
"版传感器的输出电平为 0 和 +3.3 V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:38
#: 2ee84c43c13d47528f06ed55eff16241 6111dc2333f7413db32280aa95fea0fe
#: 7729e7f0f5ce4802bbcfa2fcbc3612b3 aebaaca255984b88a9b47beafbcf1dfd
msgid ""
"The SensAItion sensor can be mounted in any orientation and the output can "
"be rotated to match the local coordinate system if needed - see the "
"configuration section below. As with any IMU, it is important to avoid "
"excessive vibration levels and it is beneficial to use a mechanical damper "
"between the sensor and the platform frame."
msgstr ""
"SensAItion 传感器可以任意朝向安装，如有需要可旋转输出以匹配本地坐标系——见下文配置章节。与任何 IMU "
"一样，务必避免过大的震动，在传感器与机架之间使用机械减震件会有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:44
#: 0c3e09c28f3c4f01b32d385b22ef11dd 33a3e1257b0e400a9ad1c77babc4aa23
#: 767d49d0a46242a387c460cd0b29a4eb a21acb9633a3409abf83db1e6de2b9a2
msgid "Configuration of the sensor"
msgstr "传感器的配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:45
#: 33f1e2d313b44e2191204d47f83c6177 634615f7270a45a1ba95b701aff02eb4
#: 928f1a82f9774a4486edb812a9ffb396 da2110eabec34f848441db7b66d5027b
msgid ""
"The SensAItion sensor has a number of configuration registers that control "
"the baudrate, output data format, coordinate system rotation and much more. "
"The configuration registers can be read and written using a text-based "
"protocol via the User UART port as described in the User Manual. But Kebni "
"also provides, on request, the Kebni INSight graphical user interface that "
"helps the user set all configuration registers and can also be used to read "
"and plot sensor data and perform a magnetometer calibration. For complete "
"control of the sensor configuration, it is recommended to use INSight."
msgstr ""
"SensAItion 传感器有若干配置寄存器，控制波特率、输出数据格式、坐标系旋转等诸多内容。配置寄存器可按用户手册所述，通过 User UART "
"口以基于文本的协议读写。Kebni 还可应要求提供 Kebni INSight "
"图形用户界面，帮助用户设置所有配置寄存器，也可用于读取和绘制传感器数据以及执行磁力计校准。若要完全掌控传感器配置，建议使用 INSight。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:52
#: 35029819ceed4113842757ffdec3a722 7cb8e4928c48433e85434322e4c55922
#: a1f2495e8e2946c998b80c208dbf16e2 e3a63d8f15414230acd5841fda7e5ce2
msgid ""
"Contact `Kebni <https://www.kebni.com/contact/>`__ for access to the User "
"Manual or Kebni INSight."
msgstr "联系 `Kebni <https://www.kebni.com/contact/>`__ 以获取用户手册或 Kebni INSight。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:54
#: 0fae89f824484e0484fb7ebe1b52a4d6 70ce2e7d66bf4949b2dbfb2fdab7b3ae
#: dfc669fed56447cfb0ad5b6c53f494b1 f72dc1c3fad0446d886692d5b2330d24
msgid ""
"To get started with the default configuration, it is sufficient to connect "
"to the User UART port of the sensor with a terminal program."
msgstr "若使用默认配置入门，只需用终端程序连接传感器的 User UART 口即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-sensaition.rst:56
